WEBVTT

01:29.700 --> 01:33.090
[Cage of Shadows]

01:33.710 --> 01:36.160
[Episode 4]

01:42.470 --> 01:43.800
What are you looking at?

01:44.520 --> 01:45.240
Jiang Man.

01:50.840 --> 01:51.830
Some people

01:51.860 --> 01:53.440
say one thing but mean another.

01:53.440 --> 01:54.940
They talk so tough,

01:54.970 --> 01:56.630
but their legs tell the truth.

02:00.240 --> 02:02.000
What a brilliant painting.

02:05.300 --> 02:06.100
Wow.

02:06.600 --> 02:08.090
There are way too many people here.

02:08.090 --> 02:11.090
They're all talking and laughing,

02:11.120 --> 02:13.630
but why do they feel so lifeless?

02:15.240 --> 02:16.920
I'll move here.

02:18.540 --> 02:19.579
Nice move.

02:21.200 --> 02:22.040
Who was that?

02:22.930 --> 02:24.120
Who threw that?

02:24.240 --> 02:25.840
Are you blind?

02:29.840 --> 02:30.680
Was that you?

02:32.079 --> 02:33.800
Didn't you see me standing here?

02:33.800 --> 02:35.000
Are you blind or what?

02:35.710 --> 02:37.500
I'm talking to you!

02:38.980 --> 02:41.640
You should apologize if you hit someone.

02:43.200 --> 02:44.470
I'm sorry.

02:46.700 --> 02:47.590
It's fine.

02:48.640 --> 02:49.900
As teacher says,

02:49.930 --> 02:51.270
when you know you're wrong,

02:51.270 --> 02:53.000
you must put yourself in their shoes

02:53.000 --> 02:54.530
and understand their pain.

03:10.960 --> 03:13.560
What you said is very true.

03:15.630 --> 03:16.790
Thank you.

03:23.420 --> 03:24.590
Class is starting.

03:24.840 --> 03:26.040
Let's go.

03:34.960 --> 03:36.680
What is all this?

03:37.840 --> 03:39.079
Are they crazy?

03:43.290 --> 03:48.160
[Elite Academy]

04:10.630 --> 04:12.840
Greetings, sir.

04:13.680 --> 04:15.040
Please take your seats.

04:17.480 --> 04:18.200
Everyone,

04:18.519 --> 04:19.450
in a few days,

04:19.480 --> 04:21.720
we'll be having another exam.

04:21.720 --> 04:23.040
So annoying.

04:24.000 --> 04:26.530
We just got here,
and already there's an exam.

04:47.690 --> 04:48.850
In class,

04:48.880 --> 04:50.400
you do not speak out of turn

04:50.400 --> 04:52.400
or show disrespect to your teacher.

04:52.440 --> 04:53.240
You...

04:54.640 --> 04:56.200
How could you just kill someone like that?

04:56.200 --> 04:57.760
She was already condemned to death.

04:57.760 --> 04:59.220
She got what she deserved.

04:59.400 --> 05:01.440
Elite Academy took you in

05:01.800 --> 05:02.880
to help you

05:02.880 --> 05:04.560
wash away your sins.

05:07.440 --> 05:08.900
As for what just happened,

05:09.480 --> 05:11.080
just consider it her bad luck,

05:11.080 --> 05:12.810
taking the punishment for you.

05:16.000 --> 05:17.400
Since you're new here,

05:17.600 --> 05:19.480
I'll give you one more chance.

05:22.320 --> 05:23.800
If it happens again,

05:24.360 --> 05:25.690
I won't be so forgiving.

05:26.720 --> 05:28.520
You are all convicted sinners.

05:28.800 --> 05:30.000
The reasons for your crimes

05:30.000 --> 05:31.520
can all be traced back to one source.

05:31.520 --> 05:33.670
Qin Yuren is truly cunning and ruthless.

05:33.670 --> 05:35.280
So what this academy seeks to do

05:35.280 --> 05:36.630
is teach you

05:36.650 --> 05:38.630
the rites women ought to honor.

05:38.650 --> 05:40.720
This assessment will be an essay exam.

05:40.720 --> 05:42.240
You'll work in groups of three.

05:42.240 --> 05:44.060
You'll each complete the exam on your own,

05:44.060 --> 05:45.600
but the group with the highest total score

05:45.600 --> 05:47.000
will be richly rewarded.

05:47.000 --> 05:48.730
The group with the lowest score

05:48.920 --> 05:50.450
will be severely punished.

05:50.800 --> 05:51.840
Your preferred teammates

05:51.840 --> 05:53.640
can be filled in during the exam.

05:53.880 --> 05:54.560
All right.

05:55.280 --> 05:56.780
Class begins now.

05:56.840 --> 05:58.440
Open Admonitions for Women.

05:59.200 --> 06:00.720
A woman has four virtues.

06:00.330 --> 06:02.130
[Admonitions for Women]

06:01.080 --> 06:02.640
First, womanly virtue.

06:02.840 --> 06:04.760
Second, womanly speech.

06:04.880 --> 06:06.840
Third, womanly bearing.

06:06.840 --> 06:09.160
Fourth, womanly work.

06:09.440 --> 06:11.720
As for womanly virtue,

06:11.720 --> 06:14.320
it requires exceptional talent and wisdom.

06:14.320 --> 06:15.520
As for womanly speech,

06:15.520 --> 06:18.200
it requires a sharp tongue and eloquence.

06:17.760 --> 06:18.370
[Strength is prized.
Women are praised for weakness]

06:18.200 --> 06:20.040
As for womanly bearing, one must
always maintain a beautiful appearance.

06:18.400 --> 06:19.840
[A woman must cultivate the four virtues
to establish herself]

06:20.040 --> 06:21.440
I've read Admonitions for Women.

06:21.440 --> 06:23.170
And it says the exact opposite.

06:23.220 --> 06:28.150
[A woman must cultivate the four virtues
to establish herself]

06:23.320 --> 06:25.320
The original book tells women
to be cautious and modest.

06:25.320 --> 06:28.560
But her version tells women
to be bold and outspoken.

06:29.960 --> 06:31.080
This academy...

06:31.720 --> 06:33.240
Qin Yuren...

06:33.840 --> 06:35.920
What exactly is she trying to do?

06:48.920 --> 06:51.640
There isn't much more food
than on the first floor.

06:51.640 --> 06:53.500
And there are so many more people.

06:53.680 --> 06:54.880
Are we even going to get enough to eat?

06:54.880 --> 06:56.080
One meal a day.

06:56.240 --> 06:57.700
No wonder we're starving.

06:58.800 --> 07:00.130
I'm getting out of here.

07:00.520 --> 07:01.960
I have to fight my way up.

07:10.440 --> 07:12.280
Hello, pretty ladies.

07:13.200 --> 07:14.120
You're new here,

07:14.120 --> 07:15.000
right?

07:15.160 --> 07:16.400
You just came up from the first floor,

07:16.400 --> 07:17.080
right?

07:17.810 --> 07:18.960
You two need something,

07:18.960 --> 07:19.640
right?

07:19.680 --> 07:21.320
We just got here too.

07:21.320 --> 07:22.790
Only a few days before you.

07:22.820 --> 07:23.720
So?

07:24.520 --> 07:26.000
We're all new here,

07:26.000 --> 07:27.820
so we should help each other.

07:28.120 --> 07:29.980
Don't you think these people look

07:31.500 --> 07:32.820
really weird?

07:32.960 --> 07:33.960
They look

07:34.200 --> 07:35.820
pretty dumb.

07:37.360 --> 07:39.000
If we team up,

07:39.000 --> 07:40.730
the exam will be a piece of cake.

07:42.120 --> 07:42.840
Sorry,

07:43.040 --> 07:44.240
you're a little late.

07:45.159 --> 07:47.090
Our group of three is already full.

07:47.400 --> 07:49.360
We can still help each other out.

07:49.360 --> 07:50.760
You might find

07:50.760 --> 07:52.040
some people are worth working with,

07:52.040 --> 07:53.320
while others

07:53.320 --> 07:54.640
should be left behind.

07:57.000 --> 07:58.730
More help isn't always better.

07:58.920 --> 07:59.920
Too many hands

07:59.920 --> 08:01.180
can just get in the way.

08:01.640 --> 08:03.240
I'm not good with strangers.

08:03.640 --> 08:04.640
So,

08:04.960 --> 08:06.340
I really don't like

08:07.200 --> 08:09.000
people acting like we're close.

08:09.680 --> 08:10.400
Let's go.

08:11.840 --> 08:12.360
Okay.

08:23.160 --> 08:24.280
Don't stand so close to me.

08:24.280 --> 08:25.240
I can't stand people like you

08:25.240 --> 08:26.900
hugging others for no reason.

08:34.360 --> 08:35.620
Where did you get this?

08:36.159 --> 08:37.600
In the last exam,

08:37.600 --> 08:38.760
I got second place.

08:38.840 --> 08:40.159
I got third place.

08:40.159 --> 08:41.919
The teacher rewarded us.

08:50.640 --> 08:51.480
Join us.

08:51.760 --> 08:53.070
Good food

08:53.250 --> 08:54.650
won't be in short supply.

09:16.800 --> 09:17.860
What's wrong, Man?

09:19.640 --> 09:20.680
Yanzhi.

09:22.160 --> 09:23.440
Maybe you should

09:23.440 --> 09:25.300
find someone else to team up with.

09:25.810 --> 09:27.830
I'll only drag you down.

09:31.120 --> 09:33.030
This is a death match in Lingya Tower.

09:33.030 --> 09:34.950
It won't be like a normal exam.

09:35.000 --> 09:37.200
If it's really about
poetry, books, rites, and music,

09:37.200 --> 09:39.080
then that Dao would be even less reliable.

09:39.080 --> 09:40.120
Yeah.

09:40.360 --> 09:41.400
You're right.

09:44.680 --> 09:45.440
Yanzhi.

09:46.040 --> 09:46.920
Then

09:46.920 --> 09:49.520
you should team up with those two sisters.

09:53.120 --> 09:54.200
Those two

09:54.480 --> 09:57.080
may seem more normal than the others,

09:57.700 --> 09:59.470
but I'd never team up with them.

09:59.760 --> 10:00.840
Why?

10:01.040 --> 10:01.700
Intuition.

10:02.130 --> 10:04.260
Those two are definitely up to no good.

10:05.840 --> 10:06.640
What?

10:07.240 --> 10:08.570
Do you want to stay here?

10:09.240 --> 10:10.240
Not really.

10:10.600 --> 10:12.730
I'm just afraid I'll be a burden to you.

10:13.200 --> 10:14.880
Stop putting yourself down.

10:15.320 --> 10:16.440
We promised

10:16.480 --> 10:18.140
we'd get out of here together.

10:18.280 --> 10:19.000
Yes.

10:20.240 --> 10:20.830
Man.

10:20.860 --> 10:21.620
Yeah?

10:21.740 --> 10:23.690
How did you end up here, anyway?

10:23.780 --> 10:25.570
What kind of crime
could a sweet girl like you

10:25.570 --> 10:27.010
possibly commit?

10:46.050 --> 10:47.130
Yanzhi.

10:48.260 --> 10:49.750
Do you really want to know?

10:52.490 --> 10:54.040
Forget it if you don't want to tell me.

10:54.040 --> 10:54.930
It's fine.

10:56.920 --> 10:58.120
I'll go get ready.

11:02.730 --> 11:04.530
For tomorrow's exam,

11:04.560 --> 11:05.760
I'll do my best.

11:06.540 --> 11:07.200
Yes.

11:24.540 --> 11:25.370
Don't be ridiculous!

11:25.370 --> 11:26.390
You took the blame for her.

11:26.390 --> 11:28.540
Everyone in this tower
is a vicious criminal.

11:28.540 --> 11:29.680
Do you know how dangerous that is?

11:29.680 --> 11:30.520
I know.

11:30.520 --> 11:31.680
You told me.

11:31.680 --> 11:34.000
Entering Lingya Tower
means almost certain death.

11:34.000 --> 11:35.400
Master was right.

11:35.600 --> 11:38.130
Everyone here
has committed serious crimes.

11:38.260 --> 11:39.850
It's best to find an opportunity

11:39.850 --> 11:41.730
to figure out their backgrounds.

11:42.040 --> 11:43.480
Know yourself and your enemy,

11:43.480 --> 11:45.880
and you'll know
when to advance or retreat.

12:38.040 --> 12:39.230
The academy has rules.

12:39.230 --> 12:40.360
After the hour of Hai,

12:40.360 --> 12:42.550
students must not
set foot outside the dormitory.

12:42.550 --> 12:43.860
Violators will be severely punished.

12:43.860 --> 12:44.620
Let's go.

12:44.650 --> 12:46.380
Come with me to see the teacher.

12:56.530 --> 12:57.610
What is this?

12:57.640 --> 12:58.660
This is a poison gland.

12:58.660 --> 13:00.290
It spreads along the arm to the shoulder.

13:00.290 --> 13:02.190
Once the poison gland reaches the neck,

13:02.190 --> 13:03.180
and enters the back of the head,

13:03.180 --> 13:04.320
there will be no cure.

13:04.320 --> 13:06.120
Isn't my mother all right now?

13:06.570 --> 13:07.360
Why

13:07.880 --> 13:09.400
hasn't she woken up yet?

13:09.470 --> 13:10.730
The poison in your mother's body

13:10.730 --> 13:12.090
has only been temporarily suppressed.

13:12.090 --> 13:13.850
But for her to fully recover,

13:13.880 --> 13:15.200
and wake up,

13:15.720 --> 13:17.650
we still need to find the antidote.

14:02.150 --> 14:02.950
Yanzhi,

14:03.690 --> 14:04.550
stop chasing after them.

14:04.550 --> 14:05.780
Master, they...

14:07.320 --> 14:08.380
Come with me first.

14:12.690 --> 14:13.810
Master.

14:14.300 --> 14:15.980
Master, what are you doing here?

14:15.980 --> 14:16.680
While I was away,

14:16.680 --> 14:18.200
you started acting recklessly again.

14:18.200 --> 14:19.360
I suspect this floor...

14:19.360 --> 14:20.640
Listen to me carefully.

14:20.640 --> 14:22.480
Just stay on this floor.

14:22.890 --> 14:24.060
As for the antidote,

14:24.100 --> 14:24.900
leave it to me.

14:24.930 --> 14:28.120
I think this floor has something to do
with my mother's antidote.

14:28.120 --> 14:29.600
Just now,I found the same poison gland
on that student

14:29.600 --> 14:31.410
as the one my mother had.

14:31.520 --> 14:32.840
Did you find something out too?

14:32.840 --> 14:34.320
Qin Yuren is meticulous.

14:34.360 --> 14:35.680
If you act rashly,

14:35.680 --> 14:37.810
you'll only play right into her hands.

14:37.940 --> 14:38.560
Don't you know that?

14:38.560 --> 14:40.280
Master, if the Tower Master

14:40.280 --> 14:41.610
finds out you're here,

14:42.040 --> 14:43.280
won't you be in danger too?

14:43.280 --> 14:43.880
It's fine.

14:44.360 --> 14:46.610
I happen to have important business here.

14:46.610 --> 14:48.020
Recently,

14:48.080 --> 14:51.780
there have been fewer and fewer people
going from the second floor to the third.

14:51.780 --> 14:53.640
And the death matches on the second floor

14:53.640 --> 14:55.350
have also been getting duller.

14:55.350 --> 14:56.470
If this keeps up,

14:57.130 --> 14:59.420
it's bound to upset the guests.

14:59.680 --> 15:00.920
You want

15:01.040 --> 15:03.040
to put Elite Academy in order.

15:03.160 --> 15:06.080
Ever since the second floor
was handed over to Qin Yuren,

15:06.080 --> 15:07.760
I haven't interfered at all.

15:09.140 --> 15:10.580
If it weren't for the fact

15:11.160 --> 15:13.620
that she can
make these tobacco paste for me,

15:13.840 --> 15:16.240
I would never have tolerated her behavior.

15:18.000 --> 15:20.930
Qin Yuren has always been arrogant
about her talent.

15:21.320 --> 15:22.520
I'm afraid

15:22.840 --> 15:24.760
she won't give in so easily.

15:25.160 --> 15:26.880
She's been at the Elite Academy
for so long

15:26.880 --> 15:28.760
that she really
considers herself a teacher.

15:28.760 --> 15:30.420
Then what do you mean?

15:30.450 --> 15:33.220
If Qin Yuren keeps
refusing to know her place,

15:33.480 --> 15:34.800
then make her

15:35.480 --> 15:37.440
just like those students.

15:38.480 --> 15:40.080
This academy on the second floor...

15:40.080 --> 15:41.040
Could it be

15:42.250 --> 15:43.850
a place to test drugs on them?

15:43.940 --> 15:44.780
Exactly.

15:45.050 --> 15:46.810
Then the poison in my mother...

15:46.880 --> 15:48.560
It must have been from an early trial.

15:48.560 --> 15:49.640
Now it seems

15:50.350 --> 15:52.830
Qin Yuren should have the clues.

15:52.850 --> 15:53.890
Good.

15:54.480 --> 15:55.420
That's great.

15:55.480 --> 15:56.740
My mother can be saved.

15:57.380 --> 15:57.940
Let's go.

15:57.970 --> 15:59.270
Let's go find Qin Yuren right now.

15:59.270 --> 16:01.470
You'll only alert her.

16:01.500 --> 16:03.330
Besides, Lingya Tower is heavily guarded.

16:03.330 --> 16:04.600
Once the Tower Master is alerted,

16:04.600 --> 16:06.430
all our efforts will be for nothing.

16:06.430 --> 16:09.180
Take the exam as usual tomorrow.

16:09.360 --> 16:10.820
I'll find a way to help you.

16:11.540 --> 16:12.870
As for everything else,

16:13.120 --> 16:14.200
I'll handle it.

16:16.240 --> 16:17.120
Master.

16:24.010 --> 16:26.220
[First Meeting]

16:39.210 --> 16:40.320
Master.

16:43.810 --> 16:46.540
Master, please teach me
your strongest martial art.

16:46.540 --> 16:48.730
I want to avenge my parents.
